hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16527","He said: Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, he said: Shubah narrated to us, and Hajjaj said: Shubah informed us, from Abd Rabbihi ibn Said, and Ghundar said: Abd Rabbihi ibn Said, from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim, he said: One who saw the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, at the stones of oil informed me, supplicating with his two palms; Hajjaj said: And Shubah raised his two palms and spread them."
